Z||000001||qwikgta||11-29-2001||05:55 PM||||Guy in our local club did it, I would recommend using the stock Fiero brackets. He did not and the seat sits to high, you really have a hard time if you don't have a tilt wheel.  BTW, most stock GM buckets will fit on the Fiero bottoms without modification. They share a common mounting position.  Good luck<P>Rob<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sig_Pic_copy.jpg"> ||||reg||1
