Z||000003||Spiff||11-29-2001||09:54 PM||||I have a set of leather Conquest TSI seats sitting in the basement. I did a trial fit and they seemed too big. I.E. you could not get to the parking break lever with the seats in. I was under the impression that the talon and the Conquest seats were the same. Maybe I will try them again if the weather is nice this weekend. Can you post some pics of the Talon seats?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spiffsig2_7.gif"> ||||reg||1
